Speaking at a press conference on October 16, 2018 at the headquarters of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, Mr. Hun Many said that the event to commemorate the heroism of the Cambodian elite will be held from November 29 to 1 December 2018, with the expectation of the participation of about 500 young people and the public.
"This is part not only of remembering history, but of wanting to do something to show our memory, and the part that we want to go through and experience is to persevere, to persevere and to work together in this cause. "It is through this 40-kilometer journey that we expect that from one step to the next, our young man can reach his destination and he can imagine his past activities." Mr. Hun Many emphasized.
