According to Mr. Lor Chanly, Prey Chhor District Governor, told Fresh News this morning, October 16, 2018, that the next action of the Department of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction is to provide a letter to the owner. To stop the construction and after the deadline, if the owner continues to violate the construction, only the commission to demolish the building.
However, so far he has not received the new policy from the director of the Department of Land, Urban Planning and Construction, in addition to notifying the owner three times.
Please be reminded that the construction of a gas station in Dai Buon village, Chrey Vien commune, Prey Chhor district, Kampong Cham province was stolen without permission, despite three bans from the Prey Chhor district governor, and now the owner is still building. Anger without the slightest fear of professional officials or local authorities.
Related to this construction, according to professional officials, the new station can be allowed to build only if there is a gap of 200 meters or more, so for the new station is opposite to the old station, that is, professional officials are not allowed to build. .
In this regard, Mr. Thuon Chetha also said that he had made a letter banning the construction owner and had already invited the construction owner to make a contract for him to dismantle the building without allowing the construction to continue. If the station owner continues to build, he can only wait for the principle from the Governor of Kampong Cham to deal with the procedure.
