(Phnom Penh): A group of 1,355 lawyers will hold an election on October 16, 2018 tomorrow to elect a new President of the Bar Association in the 12th mandate after the old President of the Bar Association, Mr. Suon Visal, expired. Candidates for President of the Bar Association for the last election are Mr. Suon Visal (former President of the Bar Association) and Mr. Sam Sokong, a lawyer of the former opposition party.
Mr. Sam Sokong, a well-known lawyer in defense of political activists, stated that the President of the Bar Association of the Kingdom of Cambodia has a term of two years and the President of the Bar Association can only serve two terms.
Mr. Sam Sokong, who has been a lawyer for 15 years, added that under the law, a person can only be the President of the Bar Association if he is a full-fledged lawyer for three years or more. Not only that, lawyers who want to run for president of the bar must not be punished by any punishment.
Please be informed that the Bar Association of Cambodia receives the main budget revenue from 3 sources, including: Member contribution of 10 USD per month, Government grants and donations from other organizations, as well as donors. But all funding is used only to protect the poor, as the Bar has a Department for the Protection of the Poor.
