Volunteer Doctors of Siem Reap Provincial Health Department Visit and Treat 1,000 People in Chi Kreng District
(Siem Reap): About 1,000 people in Chi Kreng district have received free check-ups and treatment from volunteer doctors of the Siem Reap Provincial Health Department in collaboration with the Provincial Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia and Angkor Hospital for Children. This humanitarian activity took place on October 13, 2018 in the area of Wat Lobeuk in Lobeuk Village, Anlong Samnor Commune, Chi Kreng District, Siem Reap Province.
Dr. Kros Sarath, Director of the Provincial Health Department, said that in all communes in Chi Kreng district, there are health centers that provide health services to the people on a regular basis, but the volunteer doctors come to check and treat the people. At the moment, there are some health services that are not available at the health center.
Doctors have educated all people to take care of their health and be careful about eating, focusing on eating clean, living clean to avoid any disease.
By helping to diagnose common diseases at the local level in the past, most of the diseases to be examined for children with respiratory diseases for adults, such as high blood pressure, diabetes, arthritis and so on. .
Mr. Pin Prak, Deputy Governor of Siem Reap Province, also said that the activities of the volunteer doctors to check and treat the general public everywhere in Siem Reap is to help improve the well-being of local people and avoid diseases. Special measures help reduce the cost of medical services.
For direct visits at the local level, if a case of serious illness or chronic disease is found, the team of doctors will refer the patient to continue the treatment at the referral hospital, and the team of volunteer doctors is specialized. And state-of-the-art medical equipment fitted on two vehicles.
In addition to examining and treating the people, Metfone also brought some study materials to distribute to students in this area. International Analysis: Is China the driving force behind global development or hindering global economic growth?
Of course, such statements are not new in the United States, they have been around for a long time, and in the past such statements were just some of the biases of some quarters, but now they have become. To the US government's own rhetoric for painting China. On September 17, President Donald Trump accused China of posing a serious threat to US economic prosperity.
The United States alleges that China's actions caused a trade deficit with the United States. The United States will recoup the losses by letting China fulfill its obligations as the United States needs, and the main reason for starting a trade war is the trade deficit. The trade deficit with China is a "loss". The economic powerhouse claims a trade deficit of $ 200 billion.
But please understand that they can not calculate losses on such trade. Generally, trade is a mutual agreement between the two parties for the benefit of each other. It is a voluntary process, not a coercion. We know that the United States, as a wise country, will not allow China to take advantage of it, and that China will not sell its products in the United States by force.
The United States and China are in dire need of each other in both buying and selling. According to UN statistics, in 2017, US exports to China amounted to 129.89 billion US dollars, an increase of 577%. But later, the United States decided to strictly restrict exports to China. Some high-tech products are banned from being sold to China.
According to Chinese media, China has contributed to global economic growth since 2013 and continues to rank as a key player. China has also contributed to creating a large market for the world. For the above reasons, is China a hindrance to global economic growth or a driving force for development?
Mr. Hun Manet: Khmer together under the roof of peace, other countries can not do anything
He stressed that all the policies we have today are from the participation of friendly countries and partners, but the most important thing is that we, as Cambodians, work together under one roof of peace. We ended the war and built the country by one Khmer, this is our nationalist spirit, Khmer for all Khmers.
When we have peace, stability, the development process moves forward. Obviously, in this area, we used to have nothing, but today we have achieved and in the next 20 to 30 years, we will have more achievements for the next generation, but only if we build together. Therefore, we continue to work together to maintain peace, together build our country as Cambodians, together protect our Cambodians.
Mr. Hun Manet said that we have built to this day does not mean that we do not welcome friendship with countries, we welcome all friends who are real friends, not fake friends. A true friend is a sincere helper for the benefit of our people, for the benefit of our people.
If you are a true friend of Cambodia, make it clear to each other, do not just say friends, the words behind it are destructive, we destroy peace, we do not accept. Another good friend is a friend who respects each other, some friends claim that the big country despises us. It does not matter how rich you are, it is important that we work together, respect each other, because we are also one nation.
Khmer has built the country to this day because we work together. We Cambodians decide our own destiny, we can not give orders. More than 80 percent of the people voted for Samdech Techo to lead the country. Therefore, we, the Cambodian people, do not listen to foreigners.
He added that Cambodian nationalist leaders who serve the Cambodian people do not serve foreigners. Therefore, the people voted for Samdech Techo is not wrong, we have done since our country was weak, now we are strong, when we go out, they are recognized as a nation with honor and pride. This October 14, the result: cracked 17 cases, arrested 34 people
