This announcement was made during the Deputy Prime Minister to inspect the beach and drainage system in Sihanoukville on the afternoon of October 12, 2018.
According to Tycoon Mong Reththy, who advised on the purchase of the beach cleaning machine, the beach cleaning machine will be ordered from Germany and not just two units, but three units, with two units for use in the province. Sihanoukville and another for use in Kampot and Kep.
The decision to provide a car for cleaning the beach came after the beautiful beaches of Cambodia in Sihanoukville were always strewn with debris and debris from the middle of the sea. Especially recently, there have been many snails drifting from Vietnam to the beach, affecting the beauty of the beach.
Through the Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara's beach cleaning truck, the provincial authorities will facilitate the beach cleaning work and also contribute to the maintenance of the beautiful beaches of Cambodia.
