During his visit to Japan, Samdech Techo Hun Sen met with Shinzo Abe for bilateral talks. The two Prime Ministers noted with great satisfaction the progress of bilateral cooperation in all fields, especially after the two countries upgraded the two countries' cooperation to a strategic partnership in 2013.
