(Indonesia): The Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen and other ASEAN leaders on the night of October 11, 2018, attended a banquet hosted by Indonesian President Yoko Widodo and his wife. On the island of Bali, Republic of Indonesia.
The event was also attended by the Secretary-General of the United Nations, the Secretary-General of ASEAN, the President of the International Monetary Fund and the World Bank, who attended the ASEAN Summit Leaders' Forum and the International Monetary Fund (IMF) Annual Summit. ) And the World Bank 2018.
Addressing the reception, Indonesian President Yoko Widodo praised the leaders of ASEAN, the Secretary-General of the United Nations, the Secretary-General of ASEAN, the President of the International Monetary Fund and the World Bank. Who has spent the most valuable time responding to his invitation to attend the most important summit in Bali, Indonesia.
