"We are looking at the discipline of the 006 forces to see how serious they are," he said. How much is the penalty? "We will implement the strictest measures in accordance with the discipline of the 006 forces, and tomorrow we will complete the procedure on the disciplinary council of the Sihanoukville Provincial Police."
