Speaking at Phnom Penh International Airport, Mr. Oknha Lach Samrong thanked the Cambodia-China Progress Researchers Association and the Jinan University Alumni Association for their excellent cooperation with Indravitcha University in organizing the study visit. Theory of some elites and students who have studied in the past.
The tycoon stated that the visit had four main objectives, including:
