Second, join in celebrating the 60th anniversary of Cambodian-Chinese diplomatic relations to bring closer ties of the two nations.
Third, increase the efficiency of the study of master's and doctoral degrees of elite students.
Fourth, continue the strong cooperation between Indra University and Jinan University on specialized training at the tertiary and postgraduate levels according to international standards.
