(Thailand): Mr. Ith Sam Heng, Minister of Labor and Vocational Training, and a delegation together with Cambodian Embassy officials in Thailand and local authorities of Thailand on October 7, 2018 held a Pchum Ben ceremony. To more than 7,000 Cambodian workers, businessmen and students, which took place at Wat Sisudaram, Sangkat Bakhun Non, Khan Bangkok, Thailand.
