Mr. Duong Mony, President of CamControl Preah Vihear Branch, said that on October 5, 2018, CamControl officials in Preah Vihear Province, in cooperation with the Provincial Department of Commerce and local authorities, inspected pre-packaged goods as well as other items in the market. Rovieng is located in Robieb Commune, Rovieng District, Preah Vihear Province.
He said the inspection found some expired goods, including: 32.36 liters of mixed orange juice, 6.08 liters of syrup, 7.2 liters of fruit juice, 4 kg of chili juice, and Milk powder weighs 3.2 kg as well. He said that after the confiscation, the goods were immediately burned.
