(Phnom Penh): On the evening of October 05, 2018, Sen Sok District Administration under the chairmanship of Mr. Mov Manit, District Governor and Mrs. Chea Sokhen, Chairman of Khan Council, Mr. Deputy Governor met with subordinate officials at Sen Sok District Hall. Discuss issues that have arisen locally in the past and find ways to tackle local issues.
