Ministry of Water Resources: 5 capitals and provinces of Cambodia will have a lot of rain can cause floods from today to October 11!
(Phnom Penh): According to the forecast of the Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology, from today until October 11, 2018, there will be rain across the country.
According to the Ministry of Water Resources, after monitoring the weather conditions, it was found that in some districts of Phnom Penh and some provinces such as Kandal, Kampong Speu, Takeo, and Kampot, there may be heavy rain which may cause Floods, rains, too.
The highlands will receive light to moderate rainfall and the central lowlands and coastal areas will receive scattered to moderate rainfall.
