He added that after the last action, the people reported to the authorities and immediately went to search until October 4, 2018 at 16:30 by the Siem Reap Provincial Police led by Mr. Brigadier General Huot Sothy, Deputy Commissioner for Security Planning, detained the two suspects for questioning.
