The Label Award on Exemplary Tourism Professionals in the Tourism Industry is a New Initiative for Cambodia to Encourage Tourism Businesses to Focus on Training, Strengthening Their Employees and Encouraging Tourism Workers To strive to develop its capacity to meet the needs of tourists, as well as to promote the recognition and trust in the quality of service from tourists.
