Cambodian Derivatives Exchange announces cooperation agreement with Gold FX Investment Co., Ltd.
(Phnom Penh): The Cambodian Derivatives Exchange Co., Ltd. has signed a cooperation agreement with Gold FX Investment Co., Ltd., the second notable agreement of the Cambodian Derivatives Exchange Company with a derivatives company. In just one week.
Based on the cooperation agreement, the relationship and cooperation between the two companies have become formal and have been strengthened on the working situation and strategy, focusing on the scope of increasing awareness and further public trust in investment, as well as Development of all aspects of the Cambodian financial market.
"Today is a special day for Cambodian Derivatives Exchange and Gold FX Investment to reach a business partnership agreement that is very beneficial for investors," said Chhay Leakena. I would like to thank GoldFx Investment for joining us. ”
He added that the signing of the agreement marked the solidarity of a real partner and that this was the right time to seize the opportunity to seize what the sector has to offer.
The business partnership agreement with Gold FX Investment allows Cambodian Derivatives Exchange to add another partner on the path to prosperity in Cambodia's financial markets. At the same time, Cambodian Derivatives Exchange has become a hotbed of interest from various institutions, especially derivatives.
