The Cambodian delegation of Southeast Asian Youth Ship will go out to participate in the 52-day program of Southeast Asian Youth Ship and Japan from October 23 to December 12, 2018.
Secretary of State Tith Chantha expressed optimism that the Cambodian Southeast Asian Youth Delegation will take all the good news and disseminate it and share it with the youth groups of other ASEAN countries and Japan to exchange experiences and knowledge with each other. Extensive.
