(Kampong Thom): The Department of Road Safety of the General Department of Road Transport, Ministry of Public Works and Transport, in collaboration with the General Secretariat of the National Road Safety Committee, the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, the Department of Public Works and Transport of Kampong Thom Province and the Kampong Thom Provincial Police Commissioner. Conducted a traffic safety education campaign to raise awareness among road users on the occasion of Pchum Ben.
