(Preah Vihear): With the care of people's health, focusing on eating food as well as other beverages, on October 4, 2018, Camcontrol Preah Vihear Branch led by Mr. Duong Mony, Branch Manager With the Provincial Department of Commerce, the authorities and local authorities inspected various stalls in Kampong Pranak Market in Kampong Pranak Sangkat, Preah Vihear City.
Mr. Duong Mony said that during the inspection on that occasion, the team focused on the packaging in the salad for the monks on the occasion of Pchum Ben and some drinks.
He said that as a result, they found and confiscated defective goods that were out of date, including: 11.85 liters of mixed orange juice, 22 liters of echinoderm juice, 0.27 kg grams of mixed cakes, 2 kg of tea. Canned fish weighing 6 kg and chili sauce weighing 0.5 kg.
