The report states that the Cambodian economy continues to grow strongly due to the favorable environment around the world to support a large part. In the first half of 2018, the growth of garment exports continued to reach the highest growth rate for the second year in a row. Foreign direct investment and private sector deposits grew by 14.3 percent and 22.4 percent (year-on-year), respectively.
