The Ministry of Labor announces that all enterprises will allow workers to take 3 days off with advance payment for Pchum Ben
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training has requested all business owners and establishments within the jurisdiction of the Labor Law to allow workers to take three vacations on the occasion of Pchum Ben by paying wages before the traditional festival. This too.
According to the letter from the Ministry of Labor, according to the law on holidays that must be paid for the year 2018 and for the convenience of workers during the upcoming Pchum Ben, all owners and directors of enterprises must apply As follows:
1: Allow all its employees to take paid leave on the occasion of the upcoming Pchum Ben festival during the three days, from October 8 to 10, 2018.
2: Strive to prepare to pay workers before Pchum Ben. If it is not possible to pay wages on time, please allow workers to receive at least 50% advance before Pchum Ben.
