(Phnom Penh): The National Bank of Cambodia (NBC) this morning, October 3, 2018, confirmed to the public that if the microfinance institution that advertises claims to provide quick loans without documents or collateral as an institution. Illegal and not authorized by the National Bank of Cambodia.
The statement from the National Bank of Cambodia (NBC) comes after the recent spate of text messages on quick loans without the need for documents or collateral available to residents in both Phnom Penh and Cambodia. By provinces and cities in Cambodia.
"These advertised acts are illegal on banking and financial institutions, with companies or individuals not authorized to provide loans from the National Bank of Cambodia," the NBC said.
The National Bank of Cambodia calls on all citizens to be extremely careful to avoid using informal loans, which can lead to fraudulent scams and eventual risks.
