(Kratie): The Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, together with the National Committee for Disaster Management and Kratie Provincial Authority, will distribute about 200 tons of rice seeds to local farmers in Kratie province on October 7, 2018. So that people can start growing crops.
