(Phnom Penh): During the Cambodian Day of the Elderly and the International Day of the Elderly at Phnom Penh Capital Hall on the afternoon of October 2, 2018, Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh, claimed that the citizens who are members of the Association of the Elderly of Phnom Penh are Receive free public medical services.
