In order to ensure the effective implementation of the National Social Protection Policy Framework 2016-2025, the Royal Government has prepared a law on the social security system, which will be submitted to the National Assembly for approval at the end of 2018 in order to expand the scope of the social security system. Similarly, the Royal Government has been preparing to launch a social security system for social pensions for the private sector in 2019.
