In a royal letter received by Fresh News on October 2, 2018, the King of Cambodia expressed his warmest and warmest congratulations to the Communist Party of China, the State Council, the People's Liberation Army and the people. All Chinese people on the 69th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
Through this royal letter, the King of Cambodia also thanked Mr. Xi Jinping for welcoming him and His Majesty Queen Mother Norodom Monineath Sihanouk for every opportunity to check on His Majesty's health and stay in China at all times. He stated that all members of the Khmer royal family were very pleased with this wonderful relationship.
The King of Cambodia also highlighted that the frequent exchanges of senior Cambodian-Chinese officials marked a continuation and strengthening of Cambodian-Chinese relations and attention. The care of the leaders and people of both countries for the next generation.
