Chak Smok Analyst: What successes has Prime Minister Hun Sen brought to Cambodia?
(Phnom Penh): The three-day mission of Samdech Prime Minister Hun Sen in New York, USA, ended and returned to Cambodia on the afternoon of October 1, 2018, after Samdech and the delegation In many programs as the legal representative of the Kingdom of Cambodia on the international stage.
Before leaving Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen sent a message to the people of Cambodia, "Please say goodbye to serve the nation again by using diplomacy on the international stage." In recent days, the Cambodian people have received a lot of news from the event in New York, very excited and happy.
What are the glorious achievements that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, as the representative of the Khmer nation, brings to the motherland and the people of Cambodia now?
* Second: Cambodian diplomacy is strong in the international arena:
From a country that has been rocked by superpowers, Cambodia has become a sovereign, independent and territorial state with sufficient rights and capacity to govern its own destiny. The head of the Royal Government of Cambodia has held bilateral talks with many leaders around the world, including UN Secretary-General Antonio Guterres, Prime Minister of several countries.
