In the letter requesting the intervention, the garbage collection company asked the mayor of Banlung to help and take measures as soon as possible so that the departments and institutions in Banlung city, Ratanakkiri province, pay the full amount owed for garbage transportation service from Banlung city. According to the book, avoid littering, lose the beauty of Banlung and affect the environment in accordance with the policy of the Royal Government.
