Mr. Sou Socheat said that the promotion of education and understanding of the securities sector to journalists is set in the short-term, medium-term and medium-term strategic plans for the development of this market, because the market development process can not run smoothly. No media involvement.
He added that the press is an important channel to raise awareness of the securities sector and build trust from national and international investors, potential companies and development partners to the securities market in Cambodia, as well as other sectors in the Cambodian economy.
"I would like to express my sincere gratitude to all the journalists who have always actively supported the development process of the securities market and events related to the securities sector in Cambodia, some of which have volunteered," he said. Take extra fees. "These are sacrifices and contribute greatly to the development of the securities sector as well as the national economy as a whole."
