The following are the main words of Samdech Techo Hun Sen during a meeting with Cambodians in the United States for more than two hours:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked all Cambodians in the United States for welcoming his visit. Samdech called the welcome of Cambodians in the United States an encouragement.
* Samdech Techo told Cambodians abroad that he would be the Prime Minister until the group that tried to destroy the nation disappeared from this planet.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Cambodian people in the country, even though they did not go to the polls, but made a video clip calling on local Cambodians to go to the polls in support of the democratic process in Cambodia. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the call of Cambodians abroad is right and that voting for the Cambodian People's Party is tantamount to defending peace and development.
* The Prime Minister told Cambodians abroad that he would not allow or tolerate anyone to bring Cambodia back to the flames of war at any cost.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech was fed up with the flames of war until he was blind in one eye. Therefore, Samdech does not want to see a war to destroy Cambodia again.
* In a meeting with Cambodians abroad, Samdech Techo Hun Sen recalled the history of the disintegration of the Khmer nation in the past and the unification of the nation as a whole, the end of the division and national unity unprecedented in the history of Cambodia during For the last 500 years or so, at the end of 1998, through Samdech's win-win policy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this Pchum Ben festival will have a large-scale release of prisoners and the Ministry of Interior and the Ministry of Justice are working on this. Samdech Techo called for the release to celebrate the 20th anniversary of the end of the Cambodian war and also to see the Cambodian people have the opportunity to rebuild.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech protested about the US sending Cambodian Americans back to Cambodia because they did not want to see the deprivation of Cambodian citizens, which is a pain.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told Cambodians in the United States that the priority of the Royal Government is political and macroeconomic stability. Samdech Techo said that these two issues are inseparable, that is, without political stability, there is no economic stability, and without economic stability, political stability can not be guaranteed.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the robbery is not only in Cambodia, but also in the United States. But Cambodia needs to pay more attention to security and social order.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that inflation is something that the Royal Government is paying close attention to.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech asked the Ministry of Economy to save money for Samdech, if the Royal Government encounters economic problems, it can also pay the salaries of civil servants for 10 months.
* Samdech Techo stated that the Royal Government is currently using technology to eliminate corruption within the civil service, such as ghost officials and officials who pay a lot of money to the Ministry.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's agricultural sector today is like gold but without packaging paper. In this sense, Samdech wants to set up more processing factories to process all these agricultural products for export.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also stated that in addition to the ambition to establish agricultural processing factories, the Royal Government is also considering the service and tourism sectors. However, the agricultural sector still needs to be given high attention.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the goal of the Royal Government by 2020, all villages have access to electricity, while now reached 82 percent.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government wants Cambodian mothers and children to be healthy, so now the Royal Government is paying attention to social protection services and supporting women during childbirth, both workers and poor women.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech did not disobey the opposition, as long as it was right, because some government officials were also corrupt.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech was a land reformer, that is, after the fall of the Pol Pot genocidal regime, Samdech decided to divide the land among the people.
* Samdech Prime Minister stated that Samdech hates "thieves" logging. But tens of thousands of hectares of forest cover have been lost as the land has become the property of the people.
* The Prime Minister said that in the future, Cambodia will have more rubber plantations than Vietnam.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that leading and solving the problems of a nation is not easy. That is to say, to find an effective solution between supply and demand.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is not the country of the Prime Minister alone, it is the country of all Cambodians. So let's think, the Prime Minister is just a skier.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges Cambodians in the United States to work hard to encourage their children to study hard because there is nothing better than training human resources.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech's childhood was looking for a school, but now the Royal Government has tried to spread the school closer to people's homes so that their children can get a higher education.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that do not take the case of any individual monk to destroy the whole field of Buddhism and do not take the case of any individual woman to destroy the value of women as a whole.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is the land of Sovannaphum, but why poor? There are two reasons why Cambodia is poor: poor leadership and weak human resources.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the need for development is facing conservation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech did not have the $ 500 budget for Cambodians in the United States, as some have alleged, only two books, the Ngoy group's education book and Dr. Ou Chong's book.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen ends his meeting with Cambodians in the United States at 8:58 am on September 30, Cambodian time, at 10 pm on September 29 in New York City.
