Mr. Phan Chanthul said that the distribution of gifts now to contribute to solving your life to some extent to the development contributes to improve your life even better, even if these gifts do not meet your needs. Of course, it can be solved to some extent, so please all of you should work hard to earn a living and produce more crops to increase your life to be better.
Mr. Phan Chanthul also warned all citizens to be very careful about personal safety and family, as this season has rain mixed with wind, thunder and thunder, which can be dangerous and if you have any problems in Families need to report to the local authorities that are closest to you so that the team can help you quickly and in time.
