(New York, USA): Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, stated that on September 28, 2018, he met again with Mr. McField, Deputy Secretary of State of the United Kingdom. Asia and Pacific Affairs.
