Mr. Heng Ratana also said, "As a country affected by the war, we are very proud to share our experiences and efforts to liberate the people from the threat of explosive remnants of war."
"The most important thing is that the members of the delegation appreciate Cambodia's progress and especially see the Cambodian people have confidence and hope for a real future under the roof of peace," said CMAC.
