He added that in order to reduce deaths and illnesses due to smoking and secondhand smoke, the Ministry of Health, in collaboration with relevant partners, especially the Royal Government, has established a sub-decree on the organization and functioning of the Tobacco Products Control Committee. 20 relevant ministries involved in strengthening and implementing transparency and efficiency.
