After interrogation and coordination from the prosecutor of the Provincial Court, the specialized military forces arrested another suspect, Sam Nhang, female, on the afternoon of September 26, 2018, who was the mastermind of the trafficking business. Cross-border drugs.
Presently, the exhibits and the suspects are being detained and kept in the unit for the Office of Case Management to send to the court according to the procedure.
