Sources at the scene said that prior to the incident, an explosion was heard near the Opennet fence, less than a minute after the explosion, there was a huge flame and also saw the fire prevention and extinguishing force. Rescued until almost 2 past midnight on September 27, 2018, then the fire was completely extinguished.
