Experts warn those who want to travel to space for entertainment!
From the beginning, the people who have been in space are astronauts who have been trained and prepared more than ordinary people for decades. However, when ordinary people with abundant wealth start planning to travel in space, health and safety issues will inevitably arise.
Most astronauts are expected to go into space with their illnesses, and most importantly, medical supplies are essential for such a journey. At the same time, since these individuals are not highly trained astronauts, emergency principles and medical equipment will have to adapt accordingly.
However, the most important factors in the development of medical devices for use in space include weight reduction and energy consumption. Therefore, simplifying these factors will reduce the user's training time before they can use these tools properly.
