In addition to Mr. Suon Serey Ratha, the Ministry of Interior also invited Mr. Ben Sap, former Vice President of the Khmer Rouge Party, to attend tomorrow's meeting on a letter requesting intervention in connection with the forgery of his resignation letter as Vice President of the Khmer Rouge Party.
