The group of permanent members of this main party considered that Mr. Suong Sophorn had lied to them by making a fake resignation letter, forging the signature of Mr. Suon Serey Ratha to hold an extraordinary congress to rob the ruling Khmer Rouge party. With such a request, the permanent members of the Khmer Rouge Party also asked Samdech Krala Hom to take legal action against Mr. Suong Sophorn and his party.
