(Phnom Penh): The provinces ranked No. 1 winners of Khmer cuisine in 2018 include: Pursat Province ranked as a banana soup, Banteay Meanchey Province ranked as a regional specialty, and Takeo Province ranked as a banana dessert. . This is according to the results of the winners of the 19th Khmer Food Festival 2018 of the main committee of the Khmer Food Festival of the Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts.
