The crackdown at Boeung Rong Reang and the northern point of Boeung Kak Dam, 2,500 meters from people's houses in Kang Tanung commune, Kang Meas district, Kampong Cham province, resulted in the confiscation of 45 nets, 2,800 meters long barriers Release 180 kg of mixed fish into the natural lake.
