This workshop was held on the morning of September 26, 2018 at Build Bright University with the participation of about 200 teachers, professors, students and youth representatives in tourism.
It should be reminded that the Ministry of Tourism has set its vision and goals such as:
* 2020: Create 1 million direct jobs and encourage at least 50% of professionals to have a certificate or certification in line with national and ASEAN standards.
* 2025: Create 1.2 million direct jobs, achieve the "One Person, One Skill" campaign and encourage all tourism professionals (100%) to have certificates or certifications in line with national and ASEAN standards. .
