In front of the coffin, which was officially laid to rest, Samdech Techo Prime Minister and a high-level delegation of the Kingdom of Cambodia paid homage to the body of the former President of Vietnam.
In the Golden Book of Death, Samdech Techo Hun Sen described the deepest condolences on behalf of the Cambodian People's Party, the Royal Government and the Cambodian people to the Communist Party of Vietnam, the Royal Government and the Vietnamese people for the death of Tran Dai Quang. The President of Vietnam on September 21.
