"We will always remember the efforts of His Excellency Tran Dai Quang to promote the fraternal ties between Cambodia and Vietnam, as well as bring more happiness and progress to the Vietnamese nation." Samdech Techo Hun Sen further confirmed.
President Tran Dai Quang passed away at 10:05 a.m. on September 21, 2018 at a military hospital in Hanoi at the age of 61 after more than two years as President of Vietnam.
