The People's Republic of China provided 52 census vehicles, 300 motorcycles, 450 desktop computers, 50 laptops, 30 printers, 30 slide projectors, 10 photocopiers, 200 tablets and a server. Relieve the burden of the Royal Government of Cambodia in conducting the 2019 Cambodian General Census.
These census materials will serve to prepare for the actual census from March 3 to 13, 2019, which will be approaching in the next five months.
