He strongly hopes that after going through the training and sharing experiences with each other, all participants will have a better understanding of how to write their essays in a clearer, shorter and more meaningful and engaging reader, which is useful for new ideas. More that has been trained and provided in the training course for almost a week to make the public more aware and more comprehensive, especially all major events in the country.
