(Tehran): US President Donald Trump will lose like former Iraqi leader Saddam Hussein in the confrontation with Iran, and Tehran will not give up missiles. This is the warning of Iranian President Hassan Rouhani, quoted by Reuters on Sunday, September 23, 2018.
Rohani made the remarks in a speech to the Iranian military on the occasion of the Iraq-Iran War (1980-1988) on Saturday. "The same thing will happen to Donald Trump: he will fail and suffer like former Iraqi leader Saddam Hussein in the face of Iran," he said. "And Iran will never give up its missiles."
