Samdech Sar Kheng thanked the friendly countries and the international community for their technical support, materials and budget for the election in Cambodia.
(Kampot): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, thanked the friendly countries and the international community for their technical and material support in the run-up to Cambodia's sixth national election. .
In the meeting to review the work of organizing the 6th National Assembly Election 2018 at Kampot Provincial Hall on the afternoon of September 22, 2018, Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng called on behalf of the Royal Government and the people of Cambodia still need Sincere technical and financial support and materials from the international community and friendly countries for the ongoing election process.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng also praised and commended the National Election Committee and officials at all levels, public authorities, competent forces, political parties, associations, non-governmental organizations, national and international observers and stakeholders, as well as the people. Those who have overcome all obstacles and difficulties, work together to promote the democratic process and the rule of law.
