Preah Sihanouk Provincial Governor Concludes Work Mission in China, Strives to Attract More Chinese Investors to Do Business in Cambodia
(Phnom Penh): The Cambodian delegation has made great efforts to attract more Chinese investors to invest in the Asia-World Economic Forum in China. In Sihanoukville.
Representing the Cambodian delegation that attended the big forum, Yun Min said that the Asia-World Economic Forum was attended by more than 6,000 participants from more than 500 provinces in Asia and all countries that participated in the forum. This is trying to attract Chinese investors to invest in business in the same country because China is a huge economic power.
Speaking at Phnom Penh International Airport on the night of September 22, 2018, Mr. Yon Min confirmed that first: the Cambodian delegation explained to the provincial governors to know the potential of Sihanoukville; second: to strive to form alliances with other provinces. And third, try to attract more Chinese investors to invest in Sihanoukville.
According to the governor, although some have criticized Sihanoukville for Chinese activities affecting security, he said the province is trying to improve security. He said that in a free market economy, rich countries are needed to invest because this is the only way in the modern economy today.
"There are a lot of countries in the world that are interested in China, so we are trying to attract China, and other provinces are trying to attract China to the same country, they want China because China has money," he said. A lot. "Today we can not live alone. Today, free market competition, competition to develop other countries, so from Thailand, Vietnam, Japan together, they take China to invest in other countries like us."
He also said that Sihanoukville is a province that deserves more investment because it is a place with great potential for the economy. He continued with confidence that his efforts to attract investors will be successful because Cambodia has security and good government policies make investors confident.
The Governor of Sihanoukville stated, "We have many important points because our country has peace, our government policy, strengthening security, making people trust our country, so this is a great opportunity." Together with our province of Sihanoukville is a province with favorable geography, sea, islands, air, sea, fish, sea, clean geography, making it interesting to invest in a province with deep-sea ports for import and export.
Please be informed that the growth of Chinese people has increased dramatically in Sihanoukville since 2017 after Cambodia-China relations became closer. China has provided a series of grants and loans to Cambodia, and Cambodia has signed an agreement with the Chinese government to develop Sihanoukville into an international tourist destination and a special economic zone.
