2: For mobile food stalls, there are 4 main indicators: the basic indicators of the location of food stalls and owner / vendor properties, the basic indicators of services and decoration, the basic indicators of hygiene and cleanliness, and the basic indicators of security and safety. . These four benchmark indicators are further subdivided into 40 criteria, equal to a total of 286 points.
