(Phnom Penh-Kampong Speu): Three suspects, including two Cambodian and one Lao man, were cracked down on by police in two separate cases in Phnom Penh and Kampong Speu Province, and nearly two kilograms of drugs were confiscated. Half a gram and some other exhibits.
