* The first case occurred at 23:10 on September 20, 2018 at the intersection of Street 70, Sangkat Toul Sangke, Khan Russey Keo, Phnom Penh, in which two suspects were arrested selling drugs together. Contains:
First: Name: Lor Sokunthea, Male, Nationality: Khmer, Age: 40, Present address: Sam Ang Village, Sam Ang Commune, Thala Borivat District, Stung Treng Province. Second: Sing Thin Ou Thong, 28 years old, Lao national, living in Vientiane, Laos. Confiscated 2 large packages of drugs, about 2 kg, 2 mobile phones.
* The second case occurred at 16:30 on September 18, 2018 at the point of Ang Tamao Street, Tang Krouch Commune, Samrong Tong District, Kampong Speu Province, following the rules of incitement of "A9" of the Anti-Drug Department. Operation to crack down on illegal drug trafficking.
