Authorities and police raid a gaming venue in Daun Penh district, arresting 18 men and women and confiscating several game consoles
(Phnom Penh): The light criminal police force of Phnom Penh Municipal Police and Daun Penh District Authority on the night of September 20 launched an operation to crack down on gambling and shooting games, arresting 18 people and confiscating fishing tackle boxes. Many units in Srah Chak Sangkat, Sangkat Chey Chumneas, Sangkat Phsar Kandal I and Sangkat Phsar Thmei 3.
Case 1: Lt. Col. Bun Satya, Chief of the Minor Criminal Police Office, told Fresh News that in the operation to crack down on gambling sites, the three fishing sites were located near the mosque in Village 21. In Srah Chak commune, Daun Penh district, the specialized police force has arrested many men and women and many fishing games.
Mr. Bun Sanya continued that after monitoring the target and monitoring for almost 3 months, the competent authorities have clearly identified the location and target and reached the raid operation to crack down on the above location and cooperated. With the Daun Penh district police force and the police force, the police cracked down.
In fact, the police detained 18 men and women and confiscated a total of 10 game consoles, including 5 fishing game consoles and 5 card game consoles.
After arresting 18 people and exhibits, the specialized police force sent to the Office of Minor Criminal Police of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police for legal proceedings.
Case 3: In response to the request of the people living in Phsar Kandal I, Mr. Sok Penh Vuth ordered a professional officer to inspect the location of the house where the illegal fishing game business is located at 93, Street 15. Sangkat Phsar Kandal 1 next to Angkor Hotel on September 20, 2018 at 12:00.
Case 4: With the approval of Mr. Seang Sok, Deputy Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court and by receiving complaints from local people in Daun Penh district on the morning of September 20, 2018 at 14:30 pm Sok Penh Vuth ordered Mr. Chap Dina, Daun Penh District Administration Director, to raid 3 illegal fishing sites on Street 174, Street 174, Sangkat Phsar Thmei 3, Khan Daun Penh and in Small Market Plaza (2 locations).
