(Svay Rieng): Mr. Ros Pharith, Deputy Governor of Svay Rieng Province, on September 21, 2018, said that the province's three-year rolling investment program is to prioritize priority projects within the framework of the provincial development plan. One that is easy to manage, effective and efficient to contribute to reducing poverty and improving the well-being of the people in the province.
This statement was made by Mr. Ros Pharith while chairing the meeting to review and prioritize the three-year rolling investment program for the construction of the three-year rolling investment program 2019-2021 in Svay Rieng province at Svay Rieng Provincial Hall on the morning of September 21. 2018.
