As a chocolate-flavored beverage and one of the world's leading beverages, it can be brewed with cold or hot milk or cold or hot water. A clear position for promoting positive growth in sports in Cambodia and around the world.
In a scientific sense, sports have brought many benefits to children, including physical, intellectual, and social development. Sports make children stronger and help their growth and development.
Sports help children build strong bones, muscles, strength, intelligence, help maintain their weight and reduce the risk of health problems that may develop later in life. Every time there is physical activity, it will give the child a good night's sleep and a better outlook on life. Healthy and agile children are motivated, intelligent and successful.
Through this concept, Milo will continue to further strengthen its will and commitment to help children develop and grow with sports by continuing to motivate and encourage children to participate in sports more often and give them Milo is a drink that provides a source of energy and nutrients that is nutritious and delicious and the best for health.
Milo would like to thank all the customers, especially the mothers who always choose and support Milo. This is a great source and an indispensable catalyst to motivate and motivate the Milo team to continue to strive to do a better job for everyone. This morning, the NEC held a meeting to review the work of the 2018 6th National Assembly Election.
