(China): The 2018 Internet Connectivity Expo kicked off last Saturday, attracting more than 500 companies from more than 20 countries and regions.
Co-organized by the Chinese Ministry of Industry and Information Technology, the Chinese Ministry of Science and Technology and Jiangsu Provincial Hall, this is the largest Internet exhibition ever in China.
Under the theme "A New Era of Connected Devices and the Digital Economy", the exhibition focuses on new technologies and applications in many areas, such as the Internet for the wearable device industry. Get a smart city, virtual image and virtual intelligence.
The global network of Internet-connected devices has reached a stage of rapid development, with 8.400 million Internet-enabled devices in 2017, more than the total population. Living in another world.
Statistics from the Chinese Ministry of Industry and Information Technology show that as of June this year, the number of Internet-enabled devices in China reached more than 456 million, 2.5 times more than in June last year. .
Chinese Minister of Industry and Information Technology Mao Wei stressed China's efforts and achievements in the field of Internet-enabled devices.
