(Preah Sihanouk): On the morning of September 20, 2018, Senior Minister Kun Kim, accompanied by General Phuong Siphan, Undersecretary of State of the Ministry of National Defense, met and distributed Social Security Cash Certificates to Veterans of Preah Sihanouk Province. 696 people. The ceremony was held at Sihanoukville Provincial Hall.
