(Phnom Penh): On the morning of September 19, 2018, the competent authorities of the Office of Criminal Investigation of the Phnom Penh Municipal Gendarmerie sent a suspect to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court for sentencing in accordance with legal procedures related to violence, death threats, and detention. Leave and torture.
The suspect confessed that he and the victim had known each other for a year, and that the two of them first met. There.
After they had known each other for about 3 weeks, the two of them fell in love as lovers and often made phone calls to have sex, often 2 to 3 times a week, and during each sex, the suspect. Always record video as well. The first time they had sex in a guesthouse around Sovanna Market and later they rented a condominium called MHM Room 164, Sangkat Toul Tompong 1, Khan Chamkarmon, Phnom Penh to have sex.
On September 16, 2018, the victim's aunt lost her niece all night and filed a complaint to the Phnom Penh Municipal Gendarmerie Command to help investigate and find the detention site. In cooperation with the military authorities of Chamkarmon district.
When the military police arrived, the suspect refused to open the door and even threatened to kill the victim in the room. The suspect then sprayed the glass door so that the police could not see it. In the reserve room, he escaped but could not go anywhere, and then the military police broke through the door to arrest and release the victim.
In addition, according to the urine test of the suspect, the Phnom Penh Military Police found that the suspect, who was a brutal person, was also addicted to drugs.
