Sangkat Choam Chao 2 Unity Command Forces in Local Complex Area Administration, Detains a Suspect Using Drugs
(Phnom Penh): The forces of Sangkat Choam Chao 2 Unity Command led by Sangkat Chief Va Sarang and Deputy Chief of Post Sao Sarith went to conduct administration in complex areas in their area and found a man using drugs. He also beat his wife several times and arrested her.
