According to a report from Fresh News Agency, the chief abbot of Kampong Kdol pagoda was immediately decapitated by the Wat Sleng sub-committee after being arrested by the villagers. In addition to the decapitation, local people also protested for the removal of two other abbots, alleging that the two abbots conspired with the chief inspector involved in the Srey Nhy case.
