The director of the hospital also appealed to the people that in addition to the general disease at Ang Duong Hospital, there is also examination and treatment for congenital deafness and hearing loss (severe hearing loss) to recover. Performed by national and international deaf doctors, especially with modern techniques.
Ministry of Land Management Disseminates Laws and Regulations Related to Construction in Pursat Province
(Pursat): Mr. Ly Vansot, Undersecretary of State, Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara, Deputy Secretary of State, Minister of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction, disseminated laws and regulations related to construction to Pursat construction workers and construction workers. Understand better this morning, September 17, 2018 at the KM Hotel.
Mr. Ly Vansot stated that the laws and regulations on the management and operation of the construction sector, which are being disseminated in Pursat province now, in order to provide professional officers, project staff, construction companies and construction workers to understand. Clearer, better, quality, competent and adhere to clear legal standards and professional ethics.
The standard documents related to the construction sector include: Sub-Decree No. 86 on the Construction Permit of 1997, Sub-Decree No. 42 on the Urban Planning of the Capital and Cities and Towns in 2012, Procedures for Registration of Construction Businesses , Procedures for studying design projects (architectural plans and components), procedures for reviewing design projects, and introduction of construction inspection technical equipment.
Through this one-morning outreach meeting, the Department of Construction, together with the Provincial Department of Land Management, Urban Planning, Construction and Cadastral Affairs, made a presentation with questions and answers to increase knowledge, skills and experience to be implemented more effectively and qualitatively according to the overall approach. Let's think together, do together and benefit together.
This meeting encouraged the participants to work hard to perform their duties consistently in providing better public services in line with the motto of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia: to speed up and make the service more transparent. Cadastral and construction services.
According to the sub-decree of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, all 47 officials have the same status as the Deputy Director General of the Department, while some officials have been appointed in addition to their current positions.
