Mr. Saifuddin Abdullah stated that the Joint Commission Meeting between Malaysia and Cambodia was established in 1994 and believes that this is the right time for us to reactivate this mechanism. In this context, the Cambodian delegation came to Malaysia in 2019 to attend the third joint commission meeting between Malaysia and Cambodia.
