French investor delegation to visit Cambodia in October 2018 to seek investment opportunities in tourism
(Phnom Penh): According to the Ministry of Tourism, in October 2018, a French delegation will visit Cambodia to seek investment opportunities in tourism in Cambodia, while French tourists visiting Cambodia are also Rising as well.
During the meeting, Minister Thong Khon thanked the French Government, especially the French Embassy in Cambodia and his colleagues for their contribution to the development of Cambodian tourism in the past, and welcomed and welcomed the visit of the French investment delegation to Cambodia. This coming October.
The Minister also informed about the importance of tourism in supporting the national economy, which requires the support and participation of all stakeholders, especially development and cooperation partners, and as a direction.
The Minister highlighted a number of key strategic points and requested the French side to pay attention to a number of priority areas to contribute to the development of sustainable and responsible tourism in Cambodia:
First, the importance of tourism professionalism through the launch of the "One Service, One Standard" and "One Person, One Skill" campaigns to contribute to strengthening and improving the quality of tourism services.
Second: Promoting the development of quality and rich Cambodian tourism products, especially developing Cambodia as a clean and green tourism destination by launching a clean city race, clean resort, good service, good hospitality, and in the future there will be a race movement. Beautiful beaches, a model in Cambodia as well.
Third: Strengthening tourism marketing and promotion. Currently, the Tourism Marketing and Promotion Council has been established with the significant participation of all stakeholders, public and private, to promote and support the promotion of tourism in Cambodia even more.
Fourth: Strengthening the management and promotion of tourism through technology and online systems.
As a result, the two sides agreed to prepare a draft memorandum of understanding on tourism cooperation between the Kingdom of Cambodia and the French Republic for signing in the near future.
